WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Disconnect Design Passport, or leave it
closed.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.536
Upload a screenshot with Add Design in
Conductor.

00:00:09.936 --> 00:00:14.027
Alternatively import a Figma frame with
the server integration.

00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:18.927
Add Design Notes and reload the feature.

00:00:20.327 --> 00:00:23.964
Review and approve through the normal
Conductor workflow.
